  - bound state in the continuum
  - GaN
abstract: >
  Public concept paper. In token-by-token decoding the expensive part is
  moving weights, not the multiply. OLLMU writes a frozen linear operator
  into a diffractive core so light performs the MAC in transit. Nonlinearity,
  attention, and the MoE router stay in electronics: a fixed linear medium
  cannot choose top-k, and each optical matrix pays a light–current–light
  conversion. The energy section is a threshold under named assumptions, not
  a measured win over a GPU. A burned snapshot cannot be fine-tuned.
  Implementation unrestricted; public originator credit (Anisul Wałsymzerp)
  must be kept. The license does not protect the idea.
version: 0.2.0
